treatment-versus-control evidence synthesis. Version 0.4.0 adds joint
multivariate outcome synthesis and Bayesian workflows while preserving the
dependence-aware, dose-response, meta-regression, prediction, and plotting
layers introduced in earlier versions. Backend objects remain available for
auditability and local numerical validation.
